=== {{S|étymologie}} ===
: Du moyen anglais, lui-même issu de l’anglo-saxon ''[[althagh]]''.

=== {{S|conjonction|en}} ===
'''although''' {{pron|ɔːl.ˈðəʊ|en}} {{UK|nocat=true}}, {{pron|ɔl.ˈðoʊ|en}}, {{pron|ɑlˈðoʊ|en}} {{US|nocat=true}}
# [[encore que|Encore que]], [[bien que]], [[quoique]], [[tandis que]].
#* {{exemple | lang=en | '''Although''' it was very muddy, the football game went on.}}

==== {{S|synonymes}} ====
* [[albeit]]
* [[even if]]
* [[even though]]
* [[in spite of]]
* [[notwithstanding]]

